# Blender's previous-save backup, not the file itself. Reatrget.blend IS
# committed: it is the only place the hand-marking of every clip exists, and
# nothing else in Sources can reproduce it. It costs about 21 MB per save in
# history, which is the price of having it.
Sources/*.blend1
